  "transcript": [
    {
      "turn": 0,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Um, hi. I just feel really tired all the time."
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "How long have you been feeling this way?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Two months. It started slowly and has gotten worse."
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any other symptoms along with the tiredness, like weight changes, trouble sleeping, or mood changes?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've lost about four kg in two months. I sleep nine hours but wake up not refreshed. I feel low and can't concentrate."
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you experienced any changes in your appetite or eating habits besides the weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Not really. I just feel like I'm not hungry, but I'm not eating less. I'm more thirsty than usual."
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any changes in your energy levels during the day, like feeling sluggish or having trouble staying awake?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I feel really sluggish. My arms and legs feel heavy. I can't stay awake through shifts."
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any changes in your bowel movements or skin condition, like dryness or changes in stool consistency?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "My skin is the same as before. I have eczema, but it's not worse. I don't think my stools have changed."
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent illnesses, injuries, or changes in your medication or supplements?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No recent illnesses. I take vitamin D most days and eczema cream. No changes in medication."
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any neck swelling, heat intolerance, or cold intolerance lately?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "No. I don't think I've noticed anything with my neck. I feel cold sometimes, but not sure if it's new."
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any changes in your menstrual cycle, if you're a woman, or any changes in sexual function, if you're a man?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I'm a woman. My periods have been irregular. I'm not sure if it's because of this or something else."
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you experienced any unexplained weight loss, changes in your voice, or difficulty swallowing or breathing?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've lost about four kg without trying. I don't think my voice has changed. I can swallow and breathe fine."
    },
    {
      "turn": 10,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any changes in your mood, like feeling anxious, irritable, or having trouble focusing?  \n\n[HISTORY COMPLETE]"
    }
  ],
